      "steps": [
        {
          "title": "For part (a), factorise the",
          "body": "For part (a), factorise the numerator and denominator:\n\n\\[\n10x^2+23x+12=(5x+4)(2x+3)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n4x^2-9=(2x-3)(2x+3)\n\\]"
